                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Our nonprofit's legal name is Friends of NJ Public Media Incorporated, and some platforms haven't added it to their databases yet. Entering the details above sends your grant to the right place."
